(Call flow ladder) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (One inbound voice contact, from the PSTN to after-contact work.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Caller ? Dials a claimed or ported number.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Carrier ? Hands the call to Connect telephony. This is not a CUCM SIP trunk you) Tj
T* (administer.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Inbound flow ? Plays prompts, calls Lex, calls Lambda, sets attributes.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. Queue ? Customer queue flow runs while the contact waits.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. Routing ? The profile with the best priority and a satisfied delay receives the offer.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. Whisper ? One side hears audio before the join. E911 copies CivicAddress here when the) Tj
T* (dialed string is 911 or 933.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (7. CCP ? WebRTC media. TCP 443 and UDP 3478.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8. After contact ? ACW, recording object, CTR, conversational analytics.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Sources and go deeper) Tj
